    [Doc][Model] Update Qwen3.6-35B-A3B docs for 950DT and A2/A3 (#18248)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    - Document Qwen3.6-35B-A3B deployment on 950DT Products with a
    single-NPU W8A8 MXFP8 example, C8 KV-cache option, 950DT image, and
    model weight entries. The W4A8 MXFP4 download link is intentionally left
    blank until it is available.
    - Update the A2/A3 W8A8 serving example for two NPUs, including its key
    parameter descriptions and the matching Section 9.1 configuration.
    - Update the supported-model matrix for 950DT and A2/A3. The Atlas 300I
    DUO deployment example has no net change from main.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    Documentation only. The deployment commands and supported-model matrix
    shown to users change; there is no runtime or API code change.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - Markdown lint passed on both changed files with the repository
    configuration and markdownlint-cli@0.45.0.
    - Checked the deployment code blocks with bash -n, parsed their embedded
    JSON, verified table column counts and relative links, and ran git diff
    --check.
    - bash format.sh ci could not start because pre-commit is not installed
    in the local environment.
    - No NPU deployment, accuracy test, or performance benchmark was run.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c0b6f74bee518aeaf5d72b200a0216e72fbb5e7c
    
    ---------
    
